docker compose exec web python manage.py load_songs data/merged.csv
docker compose exec web python manage.py load_songs data/clean_merged.csv --no-clean



Start the system with:

   docker compose up --pull always


 Start it in the background with:

   docker compose up --pull always -d


 View service status:

   docker compose ps


 View logs:

   docker compose logs web
   docker compose logs db


 Run Django commands:

   docker compose exec web python manage.py migrate
   docker compose exec web python manage.py createsuperuser


 Stop the services:

   docker compose down


 docker compose down stops and removes the containers but keeps the django_pgdata volume. To delete the database data as well, use this destructive command:

   docker compose down -v